    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Et si præpositus alicui eorum hominum concredere non audeat, inveniat XII plegios cognationis suæ, qui ei stent in fideiussione sua.] [Q/Br, Q/M ]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if there is any of those men whom the reeve dare not trust, he shall find twelve supporters from among his kindred, who will stand as security for him.</ab>
      </div>
